(2, 'Image Card', 'image_card_content_box_elementor', 'image_card_content_box', 'elementor', 'The Image Card contains of a small line, image, title, description and a CTA button. All rapped up with a subtle shadow and spaced out perfectly to execute fast web designs.', 1, '{\"html\":\"<div class=\\\"uc_classic_content\\\" id=\\\"{{uc_id}}\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"uc_classic_content_border\\\"><\\/span>\\n  <div class=\\\"uc_classic_content_container_holder\\\">\\n    {% if show_image == \\\"true\\\" %}\\n       <div class=\\\"uc_classic_content_placeholder\\\">\\n          {% if image_linkable == \\\"true\\\" %}<a href=\\\"{{image_link}}\\\" {{image_link_html_attributes|raw}}>{% endif %}\\n            <img src=\\\"{{image}}\\\" alt=\\\"{{image_alt}}\\\">\\n          {% if image_linkable == \\\"true\\\" %}<\\/a>{% endif %}\\n       <\\/div>\\n    {% endif %}\\n    <div class=\\\"uc_classic_content_content\\\">\\n      {% if show_title == \\\"true\\\" %}<{{title_tag}} {% if title_tag == \\\"a\\\" %}href=\\\"{{title_link}}\\\" {{title_link_html_attributes|ucsafe|raw}}{% endif %} class=\\\"ue-title\\\">{{title|raw}}<\\/{{title_tag}}>{% endif %}\\n        {% if show_text == \\\"true\\\" %}<{{content_html_tag}} class=\\\"ue-text\\\">{{content|raw}}<\\/{{content_html_tag}}>{% endif %}\\n          {% if show_button == \\\"true\\\" %}\\n            <div class=\\\"btn_wrap\\\">\\n              <a class=\\\"uc_more_btn {{button_animation}} uc_btn\\\" href=\\\"{{link}}\\\" {{link_html_attributes|raw}}>\\n                {% if show_button_icon == \\\"true\\\" %}{{button_icon_html|ucsafe|raw}}{% endif %}\\n                {{btn_text|raw}}\\n              <\\/a>\\n            <\\/div>\\n          {% endif %}\\n    <\\/div>\\n  <\\/div>\\n  {% if show_badge == \\\"true\\\" %}\\n    <div class=\\\"ue-badge-wrapper\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"ue-badge\\\">\\n         {% if show_badge_icon == \\\"true\\\" %}<span class=\\\"ue-badge-icon\\\">{{badge_icon_html|ucsafe|raw}}<\\/span>{% en