s?id=secondary\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"fe011cb\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Fundada em 2015, a Gr\\u00e3o Delivery come\\u00e7ou com uma miss\\u00e3o simples: trazer caf\\u00e9 excepcional e de origem \\u00e9tica para os apreciadores de caf\\u00e9 mais exigentes.<\\/p><p>Trabalhamos diretamente com produtores em regi\\u00f5es cafeeiras ao redor do mundo, garantindo pre\\u00e7os justos e pr\\u00e1ticas agr\\u00edcolas sustent\\u00e1veis. Cada gr\\u00e3o \\u00e9 cuidadosamente selecionado e torrado em pequenos lotes para preservar seu car\\u00e1ter \\u00fanico.<\\/p><p>Nossa paix\\u00e3o \\u00e9 compartilhar a incr\\u00edvel diversidade de sabores do caf\\u00e9 com voc\\u00ea, uma x\\u00edcara de cada vez.<\\/p>\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":25,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"_element_width\":\"inherit\",\"__globals__\":{\"text_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=primary\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"83ce3ae\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"50\"},\"hover_parallax\":[{\"layer_position_vr\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":30},\"layer_position_hr\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":40},\"_id\":\"4809c1b\"},{\"layer_position_vr\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":60},\"layer_position_hr\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":20},\"_id\":\"951e42b\"}]},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"1211f24\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.graodelivery.online\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/12\\/IMG1.png\",\"id\":50,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"image_size\":\"medium_large\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false}]'),
