_box_elementor_4050e1c .uc_btn{\n	text-decoration:none;\n    text-align:center;\n    align-items:center;\n    justify-content:center;\n    text-align:center;\n}\n.uc_classic_content{\n    box-shadow:rgba(0,0,0,0.10) 0px 5px 20px;\n}\n</style>\n                      <img src=\"https://www.graodelivery.online/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/TorraC-1.png\" alt=\"TorraC\">\n      <h2 >Ethiopian Yirgacheffe</h2>        <p>Notas florais e brilhantes com toques de cítricos e bergamota</p>                      \n              <a href=\"#\" >\n                                Ver Detalhes\n              </a>\n<!-- end Image Card -->				\n<!-- start Image Card -->\n<style>/* widget: Image Card */\n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_211ea4a *{\n	box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_211ea4a {\n	font-size:14px;\n	overflow:hidden;\n	color:#8a8a8a;\n	text-align:center;\n	position:relative;\n	width:100%;\n}\n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_211ea4a  .uc_classic_content_border{\n	display:block;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n}\n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_211ea4a .uc_classic_content_placeholder{\n  overflow:hidden;\n}\n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_211ea4a .uc_classic_content_placeholder img{\n	width:100%;\n}\n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_211ea4a .uc_classic_content_content {\n display: flex;\n flex-flow: column nowrap;\n}\n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_211ea4a .btn_wrap{\n  margin-top:auto;\n}\n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_211ea4a .uc_btn{\n	text-decoration:none;\n    text-align:center;\n    align-items:center;\n    justify-content:center;\n    text-align:center;\n}\n.uc_classic_content{\n    box-shadow:rgba(0,0,0,0.10) 0px 5px 20px;\n}\n</style>\n                      <img src=\"https://www.graodelivery.online/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/TorraM.png\" alt=\"TorraM\">\n      <h2 >Sumatra Mandheling</h2>        <p>Corpo cheio com notas terrosas e herbáceas</p>                      \n              <a href=\"#\" >\n                                Ver Detalhes\n              </a>\n<!-- end Image Card -->				\n<!-- start Image Card -->\n<style>/* widget: Image Card */\n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_f93c63d *{\n	box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_f93c63d {\n	font-size:14px;\n	overflow:hidden;\n	color:#8a8a8a;\n	text-align:center;\n	position:relative;\n	width:100%;\n}\n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_f93c63d  .uc_classic_content_border{\n	display:block;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n}\n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_f93c63d .uc_classic_content_placeholder{\n  overflow:hidden;\n}\n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_f93c63d .uc_classic_content_placeholder img{\n	width:100%;\n}\n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_f93c63d .uc_classic_content_content {\n display: flex;\n flex-flow: column nowrap;\n}\n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_f93c63d .btn_wrap{\n  margin-top:auto;\n}\n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_f93c63d .uc_btn{\n	text-decoration:none;\n    text-align:center;\n    align-items:center;\n    justify-content:center;\n    text-align:center;\n}\n.uc_classic_content{\n    box-shadow:rgba(0,0,0,0.10) 0px 5px 20px;\n}\n</style>\n                      <img src=\"https://www.graodelivery.online/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/TorraE.png\" alt=\"TorraE\">\n      <h2 >Brasil Cerrado Mineiro</h2>        <p>Doçura natural com notas de chocolate e castanhas</p>                      \n              <a href=\"#\" >\n                                Ver Detalhes\n              </a>\n<!-- end Image Card -->				\n										<a href=\"#\">\n									Todos os Produtos\n					</a>\n									<h2>Nossa História</h2>		<p>Fundada em 2015, a Grão Delivery começou com uma missão simples: trazer café excepcional e de origem ética para os apreciadores de café mais exigentes.</p><p>Trabalhamos diretamente com produtores em regiões cafeeiras ao redor do mundo, garantindo preços justos e práticas agrícolas sustentáveis. Cada grão é cuidadosamente selecionado e torrado em pequenos lotes para preservar seu caráter único.</p><p>Nossa paixão é compartilhar a incrível diversidade de sabores do café com você, uma xícara de cada vez.</p>													<img width=\"454\" height=\"603\" src=\"https://www.graodelivery.online/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/IMG1.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.graodelivery.online/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/IMG1.png 454w, https://www.graodelivery.online/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/IMG1-226x300.png 226w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 454px) 100vw, 454px\" />', 'Elementor #25', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '25-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-12-05 18:30:50', '2025-12-05 18:30:50', '', 25, 'https://www.graodelivery.online/?p=219', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
