                  Ver Detalhes\n              </a>\n<!-- end Image Card -->				\n<!-- start Image Card -->\n<style>/* widget: Image Card */\n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_f93c63d *{\n	box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_f93c63d {\n	font-size:14px;\n	overflow:hidden;\n	color:#8a8a8a;\n	text-align:center;\n	position:relative;\n	width:100%;\n}\n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_f93c63d  .uc_classic_content_border{\n	display:block;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n}\n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_f93c63d .uc_classic_content_placeholder{\n  overflow:hidden;\n}\n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_f93c63d .uc_classic_content_placeholder img{\n	width:100%;\n}\n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_f93c63d .uc_classic_content_content {\n display: flex;\n flex-flow: column nowrap;\n}\n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_f93c63d .btn_wrap{\n  margin-top:auto;\n}\n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_f93c63d .uc_btn{\n	text-decoration:none;\n    text-align:center;\n    align-items:center;\n    justify-content:center;\n    text-align:center;\n}\n.uc_classic_content{\n    box-shadow:rgba(0,0,0,0.10) 0px 5px 20px;\n}\n</style>\n                      <img src=\"https://www.graodelivery.online/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/TorraE.png\" alt=\"TorraE\">\n      <h2 >Brasil Cerrado Mineiro</h2>        <p>Doçura natural com notas de chocolate e castanhas</p>                      \n              <a href=\"#\" >\n                                Ver Detalhes\n              </a>\n<!-- end Image Card -->				\n										<a href=\"#\">\n									Todos os Produtos\n					</a>\n									<h2>Nossa História</h2>		<p>Fundada em 2015, a Grão Delivery começou com uma missão simples: trazer café excepcional e de origem ética para os apreciadores de café mais exigentes.</p><p>Trabalhamos diretamente com produtores em regiões cafeeiras ao redor do mundo, garantindo preços justos e práticas agrícolas sustentáveis. Cada grão é cuidadosamente selecionado e torrado em pequenos lotes para preservar seu caráter único.</p><p>Nossa paixão é compartilhar a incrível diversidade de sabores do café com você, uma xícara de cada vez.</p>													<img width=\"454\" height=\"603\" src=\"https://www.graodelivery.online/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/IMG1.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.graodelivery.online/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/IMG1.png 454w, https://www.graodelivery.online/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/IMG1-226x300.png 226w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 454px) 100vw, 454px\" />																											<a href=\"http://www.graodelivery.online\">\n							<img width=\"279\" height=\"127\" src=\"https://www.graodelivery.online/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Logo1.png\" alt=\"\" />								</a>\n																		<ul>\n							<li>\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M464 64H48C21.49 64 0 85.49 0 112v288c0 26.51 21.49 48 48 48h416c26.51 0 48-21.49 48-48V112c0-26.51-21.49-48-48-48zm0 48v40.805c-22.422 18.259-58.168 46.651-134.587 106.49-16.841 13.247-50.201 45.072-73.413 44.701-23.208.375-56.579-31.459-73.413-44.701C106.18 199.465 70.425 171.067 48 152.805V112h416zM48 400V214.398c22.914 18.251 55.409 43.862 104.938 82.646 21.857 17.205 60.134 55.186 103.062 54.955 42.717.231 80.509-37.199 103.053-54.947 49.528-38.783 82.032-64.401 104.947-82.653V400H48z\"></path></svg>						\n										psilva@graodelivery.com\n									</li>\n								<li>\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M380.9 97.1C339 55.1 283.2 32 223.9 32c-122.4 0-222 99.6-222 222 0 39.1 10.2 77.3 29.6 111L0 480l117.7-30.9c32.4 17.7 68.9 27 106.1 27h.1c122.3 0 224.1-99.6 224.1-222 0-59.3-25.2-115-67.1-157zm-157 341.6c-33.2 0-65.7-8.9-94-25.7l-6.7-4-69.8 18.3L72 359.2l-4.4-7c-18.5-29.4-28.2-63.3-28.2-98.2 0-101.7 82.8-184.5 184.6-184.5 49.3 0 95.6 19.2 130.4 54.1 34.8 34.9 56.2 81.2 56.1 130.5 0 101.8-84.9 184.6-186.6 184.6zm101.2-138.2c-5.5-2.8-32.8-16.2-37.9-18-5.1-1.