n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_4050e1c *{\n	box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_4050e1c {\n	font-size:14px;\n	overflow:hidden;\n	color:#8a8a8a;\n	text-align:center;\n	position:relative;\n	width:100%;\n}\n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_4050e1c  .uc_classic_content_border{\n	display:block;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n}\n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_4050e1c .uc_classic_content_placeholder{\n  overflow:hidden;\n}\n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_4050e1c .uc_classic_content_placeholder img{\n	width:100%;\n}\n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_4050e1c .uc_classic_content_content {\n display: flex;\n flex-flow: column nowrap;\n}\n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_4050e1c .btn_wrap{\n  margin-top:auto;\n}\n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_4050e1c .uc_btn{\n	text-decoration:none;\n    text-align:center;\n    align-items:center;\n    justify-content:center;\n    text-align:center;\n}\n.uc_classic_content{\n    box-shadow:rgba(0,0,0,0.10) 0px 5px 20px;\n}\n</style>\n                      <img src=\"https://www.graodelivery.online/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/TorraC-1.png\" alt=\"TorraC\">\n      <h2 >Ethiopian Yirgacheffe</h2>        <p>Notas florais e brilhantes com toques de cítricos e bergamota</p>                      \n              <a href=\"#\" >\n                                Ver Detalhes\n              </a>\n<!-- end Image Card -->				\n<!-- start Image Card -->\n<style>/* widget: Image Card */\n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_211ea4a *{\n	box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_211ea4a {\n	font-size:14px;\n	overflow:hidden;\n	color:#8a8a8a;\n	text-align:center;\n	position:relative;\n	width:100%;\n}\n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_211ea4a  .uc_classic_content_border{\n	display:block;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n}\n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_211ea4a .uc_classic_content_placeholder{\n  overflow:hidden;\n}\n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_211ea4a .uc_classic_content_placeholder img{\n	width:100%;\n}\n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_211ea4a .uc_classic_content_content {\n display: flex;\n flex-flow: column nowrap;\n}\n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_211ea4a .btn_wrap{\n  margin-top:auto;\n}\n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_211ea4a .uc_btn{\n	text-decoration:none;\n    text-align:center;\n    align-items:center;\n    justify-content:center;\n    text-align:center;\n}\n.uc_classic_content{\n    box-shadow:rgba(0,0,0,0.10) 0px 5px 20px;\n}\n</style>\n                      <img src=\"https://www.graodelivery.online/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/TorraM.png\" alt=\"TorraM\">\n      <h2 >Sumatra Mandheling</h2>        <p>Corpo cheio com notas terrosas e herbáceas</p>                      \n              <a href=\"#\" >\n                                Ver Detalhes\n              </a>\n<!-- end Image Card -->				\n<!-- start Image Card -->\n<style>/* widget: Image Card */\n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_f93c63d *{\n	box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_f93c63d {\n	font-size:14px;\n	overflow:hidden;\n	color:#8a8a8a;\n	text-align:center;\n	position:relative;\n	width:100%;\n}\n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_f93c63d  .uc_classic_content_border{\n	display:block;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n}\n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_f93c63d .uc_classic_content_placeholder{\n  overflow:hidden;\n}\n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_f93c63d .uc_classic_content_placeholder img{\n	width:100%;\n}\n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_f93c63d .uc_classic_content_content {\n display: flex;\n flex-flow: column nowrap;\n}\n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_f93c63d .btn_wrap{\n  margin-top:auto;\n}\n#uc_image_card_content_box_elementor_f93c63d .uc_btn{\n	text-decoration:none;\n    text-align:center;\n    align-items:center;\n    justify-content:center;\n    text-align:center;\n}\n.uc_classic_content{\n    box-shadow:rgba(0,0,0,0.10) 0px 5px 20px;\n}\n</style>\n                      <img src=\"https://www.graodelivery.online/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/TorraE.png\" alt=\"TorraE\">\n      <h2 >Brasil Cerrado Mineiro</h2>        <p>Doçura natural com notas de chocolate e castanhas</p>                      \n              <a href=\"#\" >\n                                Ver Detalhes\n              </a>\n<!-- end Image Card -->				\n										<a href=\"#\">\n									Todos os Produtos\n					</a>\n									<h2>Nossa História</h2>		<p>Fundada em 2015, a Grão Delivery começou com uma missão simples: trazer café excepcional e de origem ética para os apreciadores de café mais exigentes.</p><p>Trabalhamos diretamente com produtores em regiões cafeeiras ao redor do mundo, garantindo preços justos e práticas agrícolas sustentáveis. Cada grão é cuidadosamente selecionado e torrado em pequenos lotes para preservar seu caráter único.</p><p>Nossa paixão é compartilhar a incrível diversidade de sabores do café com você, uma xícara de cada vez.</p>													<img width=\"454\" height=\"603\" src=\"https://www.graodelivery.online/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/IMG1.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.graodelivery.online/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/IMG1.png 454w, https://www.graodelivery.online/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/IMG1-226x300.png 226w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 454px) 100vw, 454px\" />																											<a href=\"https://www.graodelivery.online\">\n							<img width=\"279\" height=\"127\" src=\"https://www.graodelivery.online/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Logo1.png\" alt=\"\" />								</a>\n																		<ul>\n							<li>\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M464 64H48C21.49 64 0 85.49 0 112v288c0 26.51 21.49 48 48 48h416c26.51 0 48-21.49 48-48V112c0-26.51-21.49-48-48-48zm0 48v40.805c-22.422 18.259-58.168 46.651-134.587 106.49-16.841 13.247-50.201 45.072-73.413 44.701-23.208.375-56.579-31.459-73.413-44.701C106.18 199.465 70.425 171.067 48 152.805V112h416zM48 400V214.398c22.914 18.251 55.409 43.862 104.938 82.646 2